<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Ms. Keller returns two weeks after her first visit, through the same qualified tactile interpreter, and saw the geriatric medicine consultant this morning. She has had no further falls. She has stopped using the back steps until the handrail is extended and walks outdoors only with her sighted guide. Her bone density scan was done this morning. She had no dizziness, palpitations, or loss of consciousness before the March fall; she says she reached for a rail that was not there and missed the last step. She takes no regular medicines and no over-the-counter sleep aids. She wears lace-up walking shoes. She asks for her results and the plan in braille. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Interval change</td><td>No further falls; avoiding the back steps</td></tr><tr><td>Mechanism of the March fall</td><td>Missed the last step where the handrail ends; no dizziness or blackout</td></tr><tr><td>Medicines</td><td>None; no sedatives or sleep aids</td></tr><tr><td>Footwear</td><td>Lace-up walking shoes</td></tr><tr><td>Communication</td><td>Qualified tactile interpreter; braille results requested</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

