    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No weight loss or fatigue</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No palpitations, chest pain, or lightheadedness on standing</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No pain after the fall; no joint pain</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No numbness or tingling in hands or feet; no weakness</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Some fear of falling on steps; mood good</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

